---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CloudVoid Architecture Blueprint | Case Study">
  <div class="mb-8">
    <a href="/" class="text-cyan-500 font-semibold hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">← Back to Profile</a>
  </div>

  <header class="mb-12 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 mb-4 tracking-tight">The Sovereign CloudVoid Architecture Blueprint</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 font-medium">Non-Custodial Web3 Portal & Fiat/Crypto Infrastructure</p>
  </header>

  <article class="space-y-12">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-cyan-500 font-mono text-lg">01.</span> The User Interaction Layer & Shell Framework
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-6 text-slate-400 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Global Canvas Variables:</strong> Implemented the Gemini-Aesthetic for universal scaling.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Security:</strong> The Universal Double-Confirmation Paradigm & Non-Custodial Onboarding via secure Seed Phrase Generation.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Identity:</strong> Authentication, Email Verification, Session Continuity, and User Profile Setup for Fiat Data Provisioning.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Automation:</strong> The Global Floating AI Assistant (App Brain) for real-time user guidance.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-cyan-500 font-mono text-lg">02.</span> The Non-Custodial Wallet & Web3 Portal
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-6 text-slate-400 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Asset Management:</strong> Visible Token Matrix dashboard with Cross-Chain Wallet Connectivity and seamless imports.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Transfers & Routing:</strong> Token Receive (QR) & Send (Scanner) Protocols paired with a Universal Swap Router.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Analytics & Expansion:</strong> Real-Time P&L Display Webhooks, transaction history, and an integrated Web3 Affiliate & DApp Portal.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-cyan-500 font-mono text-lg">03.</span> The P2P Marketplace & Merchant Ecosystem
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-6 text-slate-400 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Matching Engine:</strong> Conversational P2P AI Broker utilizing a Core Merchant Matching Card Specification.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Merchant Lifecycle:</strong> 200-Transaction Merchant Application Pathway and a Dedicated Merchant Control Dashboard.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Execution Rules:</strong> Precision Order Input, strict Fee Disclosure Overlays, and Asymmetric Interactive Control Rules to prevent execution errors.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-cyan-500 font-mono text-lg">04.</span> The Peer-Driven Escrow Layer
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-6 text-slate-400 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-300">Aptos USDT Infrastructure:</strong> Core escrow mechanics built on the MoveVM for maximum execution speed and security.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-lg mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">Compliance & Distribution Parameters</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <strong class="text-slate-200 block text-base mb-2">Google Play (Non-Custodial Exemption)</strong>
          Architected specifically to fall outside the strict Cryptocurrency Exchange licensing policies. The service provider never takes custody of private keys or assets. The application is strictly declared as a software wallet in the Financial Features Declaration.
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong class="text-slate-200 block text-base mb-2">Apple App Store Review Guidelines</strong>
          Organization enrollment required for virtual currency storage facilitation. The architecture supports external payment mechanism linking in compliant regions, with provisions for active login credentials/QR demo modes required for automated App Review accessibility.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>